    "sections": {
        "description": "The Home Interior Agency Theme is designed with a structured layout that helps present event-related information in a clear and organized manner. It includes responsive page sections that adapt across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices for consistent viewing. The homepage can feature banners, schedules, service highlights, image galleries, testimonials, and contact details, allowing content to be arranged according to project requirements. Navigation menus are kept straightforward to improve accessibility and make important pages easier to find. The Home Interior Agency theme supports customizable colors, typography, headers, and footer layouts, enabling visual adjustments without changing the overall structure. It is compatible with common page-building tools and includes clean coding practices that support readability and maintenance. Sections for event listings, speaker profiles, venue details, pricing information, FAQs, and inquiry forms can be added where needed. Social media links, map integration, and newsletter subscription areas are also supported. The overall layout emphasizes organized content presentation while maintaining a balanced visual design suitable for websites focused on showcasing schedules, announcements, galleries, and related information."
    },
